      "description": "Timings: Doors 7:00 PM, Music 7:30 PM - 1 set of music (SOLD OUT) *New show added due to popular demand* Doors 9:30 PM, Music 10:00 PM - 1 set of music Line-up: Thurston Moore - Guitar Mark Wastell - Percussion About: A very welcomed return to the Vortex for the exciting electric guitar and drums collaboration between Thurston Moore and Mark Wastell. They played to a sell out audience last December, a show which was described as “deeply post-psychedelic, dreamlike in atmosphere, before expanding into the charming spasms of free jazz.” Two vastly experienced masters of the craft. Guaranteed to be another sell out - don’t hesitate to book your ticket. Photos by Sean Kelly, Vortex Jazz Club, December 2025. [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUbYqrQDoqw[/embed]",
