      "dedupe_key": "one-orchestra-new|2026-11-10|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "Doors 7:45 PM, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music Line-up: Caroline Kraabel – alto sax/voice Katherine Farnden - oboes Kamila Wielebska - voice/dance Iris Casling – double bass Cath Roberts – saxes/electronics Dee Byrne – alto sax Sue Lynch - tenor sax/flute/clarinet Bara Noha – voice Rosa Theodora – keyboards/piano/voice Emmanuelle Waeckerle - voice/objects Saori Miraku - piano/keyboards Kri – voice Shama Rahman – sitar Megan Steinberg – turntables Jane Perrot – voice Ana Chora - electric guitar Barbara Mukoda - flutes About: ONe_Orchestra New work in large-group improvisation to free themselves and their listeners from the default assumptions built up through the centuries-long predominance of cis men in music... This improvising orchestra's work opens up novel, important, and fascinating new forms, relations, AND sounds. Improvisation is, by necessity, a big part of being and surviving as ‘other’; conversely, otherness – that everyone experiences somewhere in their heart – has a huge influence on the creation of improvisation. The shared experiences and sense of safety among ONe_Orchestra New members allow them to explore more boldly in their quest to uncover new ways of hearing, as well as new things to hear.",
      "ends_at": "2026-11-10T22:30:00Z",
