      "description": "Doors 6:45 PM, Music 7:15 PM - 1 set of music Line-up: Alex Bonney - Trumpet Olie Brice - Double bass George Crowley - Tenor Saxophone Sacha Harlan - Drum kit About: A top-flight quartet of UK improvisers blow their way through legendary free jazz repertoire from the likes of Ornette Coleman, Don Cherry, Albert Ayler & Paul Motian",
