      "dedupe_key": "after-john-cosmic-music-of-alice-coltrane|2026-11-13|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "PRESENTED BY ALINA BZHEZHINSKA, TONY KOFI & YOUSUF ALI KHAN Doors 7:45 PM, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music Line-up: Alina Bzhezhinska - Harp Tony Kofi - Saxophone Yousuf Ali Khan - Tabla About: Award-winning duo Alina Bzhezhinska (harp) and Tony Kofi (saxophone), joined by tabla virtuoso Yousuf Ali Khan, present After John, a celebration of the visionary music Alice Coltrane created following the passing of her husband and greatest musical collaborator, John Coltrane. Blending jazz, Indian classical traditions and spiritual improvisation, this captivating performance explores her transcendent musical legacy, taking audiences on an immersive journey of beauty, contemplation and joy. Created exclusively for the EFG London Jazz Festival, this special performance is a rare, one-off event not to be missed. [embed]https://youtu.be/0nMBSauwTdU?si=MB8kcUtgL2S_kyOW[/embed]",
      "ends_at": "2026-11-13T22:30:00Z",
