      "dedupe_key": "ari-hoenig-trio-featuring-tom-ollendorff-viktor-nyberg-2-shows|2026-11-14|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "Timings: *Please note each ticket will give you access to the time slot you book for. Please arrive for the door time. 1st Show Doors 6:30 PM, Music 7:00 PM – 1 set of music 2nd Show Doors 8:30 PM, Music 9:00 PM – 1 set of music Line-up: Tom Ollendorff - Guitar Viktor Nyberg - Double bass Ari Hoenig - Drum kit About: Following his sold-out appearances at the Vortex in 2022, legendary New York drummer Ari Hoenig returns with his acclaimed trio featuring Tom Ollendorff and Viktor Nyberg. Widely regarded as one of the jazz world's leading drummers and among its most celebrated contemporary musicians, Hoenig is renowned for his astonishing rhythmic imagination and melodic approach to the drum kit. Performing music from their critically acclaimed album Enchanted, the trio combines Hoenig's innovative rhythmic approach with Ollendorff's lyrical guitar work and Nyberg's deeply melodic bass playing, creating music of remarkable interplay, subtlety and spontaneity. [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d1zPpLdc-Go&list=RDd1zPpLdc-Go&start_radio=1&t=8s[/embed] Event Date",
