      "category": "music",
      "dedupe_key": "downstairs-living-presents-songs-of-joni-mitchell-with-rebecka-edlund-immy-churchill|2026-11-20|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "Doors 6:45 PM, Music 7:15 PM - 1 set of music About: Joni Mitchell is a cornerstone in the musical lives of Rebecka Edlund and Immy Churchill. These two singer-songwriters connected over their love of albums such as 'Blue' and 'Hejira' and have immersed themselves in this music over the last decade. For the 2026 London Jazz Festival, the curators of The Downstairs Living Room warmly invite you to an evening of Joni Mitchell classics, paired with their own original songs. For lovers of \"A Case of You\", \"Coyote\" and \"Amelia\" this will be a night of nostalgia and stories; shared through two voices, two guitars and a harmonium. Rebecka Edlund and Immy Churchill, plus special guests.",
      "ends_at": "2026-11-20T20:15:00Z",
