  {
    "event": {
      "address": "11 Gillett Square, Dalston, London N16 8AZ",
      "all_day": false,
      "category": "music",
      "dedupe_key": "james-allsopp-group|2026-11-21|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "Doors 7:45 PM, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music Line-up: James Allsopp - Tenor saxophone, Synthesizer Chris Batchelor - Trumpet Zands Duggan - Percussion Dave Storey - Drum kit Riaan Vosloo - Bass guitar About: For this performance we will be playing music from our forthcoming album “The Forest Speaks” set for release on London based Batov records in 2027. The album has been produced in collaboration with Ben Lamdin (Nostalgia 77) and the psychedelic, dub aesthetic of the production enhances and deepens the atmosphere of the record and that’s the experience we want to give the listener at the gig! This is joyous, life affirming music. Deceptively simple, deeply melodic with a healthy dose of the other worldly. [embed]https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bTaJCvFRp7o&pp=ygUcSmFtZXMgYWxsc29wcCBncm91cCBmaXNodGFuaw%3D%3D&ra=m https://open.spotify.com/album/2x18fkRYPpfmVIvAlPi8wm?si=OBTNrZSMRwGQfllXO5NhfA&utm_source=copy-link[/embed]",
