      "description": "Doors 7:45 PM, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music Line-up: John Etheridge - Guitar Vimala Rowe - Vocals Pete Whittaker - Organ Ian Thomas - Drum kit About: The sensational vocalist Vimala Rowe joins guitar legend John Etheridge's Blue Spirits (Pete Whittaker (organ) and Ian Thomas (drums) for a post Christmas treat of jazz, blues and global music. Vimala and John have a long established and celebrated partnership and the Blue Spirits Trio is ever popular at the Vortex. This will be a soulful and powerful night.",
