      "dedupe_key": "ian-shaws-new-years-eve-bash|2026-12-31|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "Doors 9:30 PM, Music 10:15 PM About We are delighted to welcome back the multi-award winning Ian Shaw (vocals, piano) for his traditional New Year’s Eve performance. Only on this special night at The Vortex does Shaw mix up his teen favourites (Elton, Bowie, Billy Joel, Stevie Wonder) with some legendary old blues and soul bangers. Add some seasonally satirical comedy originals, singalongs and, in the company of 'simply our finest' (Time Out), Shaw will whip up an unforgettable ‘Hello 2027’ evening.",
