      "dedupe_key": "procrastinators-nye-party|2027-01-01|vortex-jazz-club",
      "description": "Doors 7:45 PM, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music Line-up: Gina Boreham - Voice Piotr Jordan - Violin Paul Moylan - Double bass Zac Gvirtzman - Piano About: Please join the Procrastinators as they celebrate the New Year - as per tradition - one day late. So you can stay at home and do your first-footing, watch Jools Holland or hit your local. Then come and celebrate for real on 1st January - with great music, good company, normal prices and a countdown to midnight at a time that suits - using the special Procrastinators' Clock. Gypsy and Hotclub jazz, tango, Klezmer and some jazz standards from some of the best musos in London!",
